Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:19.70,0:01:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝下流汗春药的女社员\N忍不住在我眼前脱光了衣服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.33,0:03:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.06,0:03:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有,没事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.49,0:03:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(英语)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.58,0:04:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(英语)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.66,0:04:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(英语)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.61,0:04:24.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(英吾)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:28.42,0:04:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(英语)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.16,0:04:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(英语)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.91,0:05:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对方说没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.98,0:05:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！我知道了！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:04.85,0:05:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,归国子女果然就是不一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你比起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:12.46,0:05:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的是太没用了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.66,0:05:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也只是英语比较好一点而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的企划案你不是很努力\N的在做了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.60,0:05:25.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说我很努力....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.67,0:05:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明明是同时进公司的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.94,0:05:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我却只能在旁边帮忙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.62,0:05:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:36.89,0:05:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用这种消极的想法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然会什么都做不好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.56,0:05:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出精神来嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.10,0:05:51.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样消极当然会什么\N都做不好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.97,0:05:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加油哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.91,0:06:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再这么消极了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.05,0:06:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出干劲来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.71,0:06:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.12,0:06:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样我才受不了\N你这种归国了女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.72,0:06:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为...如果是日本人的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.33,0:06:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人这样抱住
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对会以为你是不是喜欢我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.20,0:06:30.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昌本人就是这样才会被人家\N当小孩了看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.61,0:06:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说这种小鬼才会说的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.54,0:06:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专心工作吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.26,0:07:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原子笔呢....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.06,0:07:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉到地上了吗.....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.00,0:08:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平常受您照顾了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.34,0:08:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下星期
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.67,0:08:47.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下星期的话....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.08,0:08:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星期六那天....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.78,0:10:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的，我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.78,0:10:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.19,0:11:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.17,0:12:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好热....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.28,0:13:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈热....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.89,0:13:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好热！冷气是不是坏了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:32.29,0:13:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是，是吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.10,0:13:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒觉得有点冷诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.24,0:13:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.71,0:13:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我受得热吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.71,0:13:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这么热呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:54.32,0:13:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么只有我得得热
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:13.78,0:18:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈、哈罗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.85,0:18:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个....不好意思\N我不会说英文
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:21.12,0:18:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂、懂英文的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.46,0:18:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在不在诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:30.59,0:18:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.06,0:18:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A..，BIK0....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:37.67,0:18:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么??
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.41,0:18:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST   D0....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.28,0:18:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,YES     YeS
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.02,0:18:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:58.75,0:19:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,SORRY    SORRY
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.82,0:19:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的电话吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:05.43,0:19:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，对方挂断了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:09.83,0:19:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等会他应该还会再打过来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.72,0:19:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚跑去那里了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.19,0:19:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没、没有啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:07.26,0:25:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:13.93,0:25:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么没穿内裤?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:37.01,0:27:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:17.16,0:41:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在还只是新人而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:20.10,0:41:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上班的时候认真点好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:22.63,0:41:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟是不是新人有关系吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:25.03,0:41:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是照自己的步骤\N去工作而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:34.51,0:41:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是你负责扫厕所吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:39.05,0:41:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思，我下星期会扫的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:42.12,0:41:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下星期?你今天还没扫欸！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:45.19,0:41:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下星期再扫也没关系吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:47.46,0:41:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厕所每天都要扫好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:51.73,0:41:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在就过去扫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:55.60,0:41:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，伊口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:58.93,0:41:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:59.87,0:42:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去帮忙她扫厕所
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:02.67,0:42:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我帮她啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:04.27,0:42:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,:我怕她会偷懒随便扫啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:15.75,0:42:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要再凶一点啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:17.22,0:42:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然人家会瞧不起你哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:20.69,0:42:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:24.16,0:42:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:04.60,0:43:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认真一点扫啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:07.40,0:43:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就可以了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:12.07,0:43:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:14.34,0:43:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经很干净了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:47.18,0:43:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青田，那还很脏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:50.51,0:43:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里很干净啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:52.78,0:43:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地上还有污垢啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:46.30,0:44:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:48.17,0:44:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次卡摘0K大赛的处罚\N你还记得吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:52.31,0:44:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:53.91,0:44:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一整天都要听赢的人的命令
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:56.98,0:44:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:58.85,0:45:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在想要开始那个处罚\N可以吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:02.32,0:45:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:04.72,0:45:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你把这里扫干净
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:10.46,0:45:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:13.26,0:45:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我口渴了，去帮我买饮料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:17.93,0:45:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别开玩笑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:20.47,0:45:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时是你自己要答应的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:25.01,0:45:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我记着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:58.64,0:46:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:01.04,0:46:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有认真去扫厕所吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:03.98,0:46:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她根本就不想扫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:07.58,0:46:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗....
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:10.92,0:46:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:13.32,0:46:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:14.79,0:46:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这里有个好东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:23.07,0:46:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:25.07,0:46:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶?这是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:41.08,0:46:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:43.35,0:46:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不客气了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:11.04,0:48:12.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:13.31,0:48:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得有点热...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:17.31,0:48:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是，是哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:19.85,0:48:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很热吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:39.11,0:51:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去上个厕所哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:08.38,0:57:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况如何
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:11.71,0:57:14.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很成功
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:16.12,0:57:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶，青田跑那去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:19.59,0:57:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她去那摸鱼了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:20.92,0:57:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在上厕所
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:23.46,0:57:25.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:26.66,0:57:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，青田，你有认真在\N扫厕所吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:32.80,0:57:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不认真扫厕所的话\N明天开始你就不用来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:40.94,0:57:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可要温柔一点哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:51.09,0:57:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:54.16,0:57:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到他说的话了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:57.09,0:57:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好还是认真扫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:27.12,0:58:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续扫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:36.07,0:58:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那个扫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:39.54,0:58:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续扫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:17.17,0:59:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认真一点好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:20.11,0:59:21.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跪在地上扫啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:27.58,0:59:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两只手一起用啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:38.66,0:59:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再用力一点抹啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:03.89,1:00:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再用力一点啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:06.96,1:00:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然你会被开除哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:09.63,1:00:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:22.84,1:00:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是叫你用两只手吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:31.65,1:00:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认真一点扫啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:48.06,1:00:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才也听到他说的话了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:57.14,1:00:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认真一点啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:38.91,1:01:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续扫啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:45.59,1:01:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:52.80,1:01:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在喘什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:06.81,1:02:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很兴奋吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:07.51,1:07:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本公司...今年度的总结算
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:13.12,1:07:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说大声一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:17.92,1:07:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年公司的纯收益为\N二千五百亿圆
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:25.26,1:07:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从明年开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:28.06,1:07:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本公司的营业将会提出
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:33.14,1:07:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话时要精神点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:35.80,1:07:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:37.41,1:07:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你进公司几年啦?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:40.48,1:07:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三年了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:43.15,1:07:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三年?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:45.28,1:07:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就看不出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:47.42,1:07:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是、是吗...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:10.51,1:08:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:12.11,1:08:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:13.18,1:08:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你脸色怎么那么差?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:15.58,1:08:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不..，那个...我刚刚...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:18.51,1:08:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被前辈骂的好惨
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:22.12,1:08:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:24.79,1:08:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才有点....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:27.86,1:08:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要用这个向她报仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:36.40,1:08:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们打算使用这样东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:42.81,1:08:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:45.07,1:08:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得不错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:46.94,1:08:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么其他的意见吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:48.54,1:08:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个吗......
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:50.41,1:08:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边在加多一点比较好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:54.95,1:08:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你介绍一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:56.55,1:09:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也是这次企划案的一员\N是我的部属他叫   冈野
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:01.49,1:09:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是冈野，请多指教
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:07.23,1:09:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把茶拿给人家啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:11.23,1:09:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不好意思啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:14.70,1:09:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:32.45,1:09:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那个比较好呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:35.52,1:09:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:36.86,1:09:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好是用坚硬一点材质此较好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:45.00,1:09:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:47.40,1:09:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还有很多种颜色
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:51.14,1:09:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边也有很多种
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:54.74,1:09:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的也是...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:58.75,1:10:00.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厨房的话...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:05.69,1:10:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这边的不错.....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:09.83,1:10:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有点贵诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:14.10,1:10:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再看一看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:28.38,1:10:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你觉得如何?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:31.85,1:10:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个还蛮受女生欢迎的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:46.66,1:10:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边的也挺不错的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:49.47,1:10:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:51.60,1:10:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以这样的预算来看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:53.87,1:10:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个等级的材算算不错了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:06.82,1:11:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这个呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:10.29,1:11:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个吗...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:14.42,1:11:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是可以啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:17.63,1:11:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是可以用这个啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:20.96,1:11:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样预算会够用吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:24.57,1:11:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个应该是没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:38.05,1:11:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先把资料再重新\N整理一次好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:40.18,1:11:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的，麻烦你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:51.93,1:11:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:01.94,1:12:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需不需要看样品?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:09.55,1:12:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你方便的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:11.81,1:12:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我下欠会带样品过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:15.28,1:12:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就麻烦你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:45.45,1:12:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是约下礼拜几开会?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:49.32,1:12:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个吗...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:47.75,1:17:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:30.99,1:18:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于这样产品
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:35.00,1:18:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想是不是要\N稍微做一下变化比较好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:46.74,1:18:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样产品的价格
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:49.28,1:18:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对年轻人来说负担太大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:54.48,1:18:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:03.03,1:19:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你、你说的没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:06.50,1:19:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看建议售价
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:08.36,1:19:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好是在稍微....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:13.04,1:19:16.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的，以后也要麻烦您了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:18.11,1:19:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先告辞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:18.30,1:20:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:20.44,1:20:22.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚是在搞什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:25.51,1:20:31.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你差点就把这次的合约\N给搞砸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:36.19,1:20:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:38.32,1:20:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在这是什么德性?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:44.73,1:20:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在公司里能穿成这样了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:47.26,1:20:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:55.94,1:20:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:58.87,1:21:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天发生的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:01.68,1:21:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会去跟部长报告的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:07.42,1:21:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还用我说吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:10.62,1:21:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这么重要的会议上
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:12.62,1:21:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟然穿成这副德性
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:14.89,1:21:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:21.43,1:21:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:24.10,1:21:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再让我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:26.90,1:21:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是穿成什么样了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:43.19,1:21:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:45.72,1:21:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:14.24,1:28:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:16.78,1:28:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:21.72,1:28:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:24.39,1:28:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长刚何出去用餐了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:29.33,1:28:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:31.19,1:28:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等了他一天了诶...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:36.40,1:28:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:38.53,1:28:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正常来说....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:42.00,1:28:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他大概要个小时后\N才会回来诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:46.28,1:28:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:48.28,1:28:50.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就在这里等他吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:48.74,1:29:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶!
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:52.47,1:29:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们社长....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:54.48,1:29:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多照顾你啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:57.28,1:29:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照顾?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:59.01,1:30:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:02.62,1:30:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该明白我的意思吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:08.76,1:30:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:11.56,1:30:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该懂吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:14.23,1:30:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们做到什么地步了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:20.77,1:30:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是那种关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:27.18,1:30:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有没有趁着上班时间.....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:31.05,1:30:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷做那档了事?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:36.52,1:30:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看起来性欲很强的样了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:39.86,1:30:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从来没做过那种事啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:42.12,1:30:43.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:46.13,1:30:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在有男友吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:51.20,1:30:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:53.60,1:30:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:57.07,1:30:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会觉得寂寞吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:03.75,1:31:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实你和他有发生关系吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:06.42,1:31:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:09.75,1:31:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你和谁有关系?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:14.82,1:31:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这种年年纪的女生\N一定有一、两个性伴侣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:19.50,1:31:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个吗....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:21.76,1:31:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难不成....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:23.63,1:31:25.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都是靠自慰来解决啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:28.97,1:31:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不做那种事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:33.51,1:31:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实你有吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:36.45,1:31:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:43.79,1:31:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你不学得寂寞吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:47.66,1:31:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会啊...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:59.67,1:32:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你长的这么挺不错的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:01.94,1:32:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身材也不差
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:04.87,1:32:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样真是太可惜了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:15.28,1:32:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的肩膀有点僵硬哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:17.82,1:32:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请、请你不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:19.69,1:32:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定很累吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:21.29,1:32:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我、我不累
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:26.10,1:32:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不、不用了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:28.76,1:32:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...请你住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:31.70,1:32:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:34.64,1:32:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这个人可是很温柔体贴的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:37.57,1:32:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不用了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:40.51,1:32:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要客气嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:43.31,1:32:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定很寂寞吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:45.58,1:32:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有那种事..
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:50.39,1:32:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你佳手...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:52.52,1:32:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用客气嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:54.79,1:32:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有在客气...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:57.86,1:32:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会帮你保密的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:00.80,1:33:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不用了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:02.67,1:33:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正他还不会回来啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:05.47,1:33:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:07.20,1:33:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别这样嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:09.20,1:33:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我也刚好没有女朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:14.01,1:33:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:17.88,1:33:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:19.48,1:33:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都还没做啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:22.02,1:33:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何必这样拒绝我呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:24.55,1:33:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要碰我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:30.43,1:33:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这样...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:41.37,1:33:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你住手...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:45.37,1:33:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:50.18,1:33:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:51.78,1:33:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你不要这样好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:54.45,1:33:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你又没有男朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:56.85,1:34:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这样我会去\N跟社长报告哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:10.19,1:36:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚、刚才对不起了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:13.66,1:36:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像有点太得意忘形了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:16.59,1:36:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:17.93,1:36:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算不上是赔罪啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:19.53,1:36:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，我帮你泡了杯茶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:22.06,1:36:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:23.80,1:36:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，我有点得意忘形了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:27.00,1:36:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是....
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:32.34,1:36:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:34.08,1:36:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我喝了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:44.75,1:36:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好喝哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:59.70,1:37:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的茶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:45.67,1:38:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:47.01,1:38:50.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘记拿资料过来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:24.07,1:45:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，你好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:36.09,1:45:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会不会，没有那种事啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:43.43,1:45:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:46.76,1:45:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是这样的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:51.70,1:45:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后天...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:54.77,1:45:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:56.77,1:45:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会去做一下修改的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:02.24,1:46:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:05.85,1:46:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:08.12,1:46:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:09.45,1:46:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后也要麻烦你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:12.92,1:46:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:24.53,1:46:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:26.67,1:46:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个沙泼是怎么了？？
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:32.27,1:46:34.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面好像有污垢诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:37.21,1:46:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长很受干净的\N你最好要擦一下哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:43.49,1:46:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椅背那边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:11.91,1:47:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,座垫也脏了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:14.58,1:47:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,座、座垫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:19.66,1:47:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:24.59,1:47:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面积了不少污垢哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:40.08,1:47:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再里面一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:58.09,1:47:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这里吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:01.30,1:48:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隙缝里面也有
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:11.57,1:48:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再里面一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:13.31,1:48:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再里面一点吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:12.84,1:49:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再里面一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:42.33,1:49:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你裙子里面没穿?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:56.88,1:49:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在社长的办公室里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:01.02,1:50:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故意不穿内裤
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:04.62,1:50:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是有什么目的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:08.09,1:50:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:20.37,1:50:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然没导嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:51.79,1:51:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要靠近我...

